}

docs {
  # Update Mitra Kerja Riset
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `PUT /api/mitra-kerja-riset/:id`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token  
  **Role Required:** Admin
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request)
  
  ### Path Parameters
  | Param | Type | Required |
  |-------|------|----------|
  | id | UUID | ✅ |
  
  ### Body (JSON)
  ```typescript
  interface UpdateMitraDTO {
    nama?: string;
    alamat?: string;
    kota?: string;
    negara?: string;
    kontak?: string;
    email?: string;
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Berhasil memperbarui mitra kerja riset",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Message |
  |--------|---------|  
  | 401 | Token tidak valid |
  | 403 | Akses ditolak |
  | 404 | Mitra tidak ditemukan |
}
